e<div style=\"display:inline\">​, </div></font><div style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif;display:inline\">​</div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif\">B.S. Animal Science</span><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif\">​</span><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><div style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif;display:inline\">​</div><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif\">KristinaMWolf.com</span></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">Restoration Ecology Lab</font></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><div style=\"display:inline\">​</div></font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif\">Department of Plant Sciences<div style=\"display:inline\">​</div></span></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif\"><div style=\"display:inline\">University of California, Davis​</div></span></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><div style=\"display:inline\">​</div></font><span style=\"font-family:&#39;times new roman&#39;,serif\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20750-9771\" value=\"+15307509771\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530) 750-9771</a></span></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">&quot;We have to remember that what we observe is not nature herself, but nature exposed to our method of questioning.&quot; ~ Werner Heisenberg</font></div></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"> </font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
